/* ============================================================================
   Pacelab backend (Cloudflare Worker)  —  Strava + Stripe + protected course data
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   ENDPOINTS
     POST /exchange  Strava OAuth code -> realistic marathon estimate (unchanged)
     POST /unlock    comp/test code    -> { ok, pass } (pass unlocks all paid)
     POST /data      { pass? }         -> elevation data: free always, paid only
                                          when the signed pass grants it
     POST /verify    { session_id }    -> verifies a paid Stripe Checkout session,
                                          records entitlement in KV by email,
                                          returns a signed pass
     POST /restore   { email }         -> re-issues a pass from a recorded purchase

   SETUP (Cloudflare dashboard -> your Worker)
   1. Settings -> Variables and Secrets:
        SECRET    STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET   (existing)
        VARIABLE  STRAVA_CLIENT_ID       (existing)
        VARIABLE  UNLOCK_CODE            (existing)
        VARIABLE  ALLOWED_ORIGIN         = https://pacelab.me   (optional)
        SECRET    STRIPE_SECRET_KEY      = your Stripe secret key (sk_live_...)
        SECRET    TOKEN_SECRET           = any long random string (sign passes)
   2. Storage & Databases -> KV -> Create namespace "pacelab-entitlements".
      Then this Worker -> Settings -> Bindings -> add KV binding:
        Variable name: ENTITLEMENTS   ->   the namespace you just made
   3. Paste this whole file into Edit code -> Deploy.
   ============================================================================ */

